          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} — practical frameworks, habit systems, and membership options to sustain progress.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0f1113; --card:#0f1316; --muted:#9aa5a8; --accent:#d9b08c; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\\n      --maxw:1100px; --radius:12px; --gap:20px; --accent-2:#bfa07e;\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071014 0%, #071218 40%);color:#e6eef0;line-height:1.45}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:24px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#081214}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a.primary{color:#071214;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;margin-left:24px;font-weight:600}\\n\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border-radius:16px}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}\\n    .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .hero .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .pill{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .hero-visual{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    .hero-visual img{width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}\\n\\n    /* Myth vs Truth ripple */\\n    .myth-truth{margin-top:30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}\\n    .mt-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .mt-card h3{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:15px}\\n    .mt-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .myth{background:#2a2f31;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;color:#f2c7a1}\\n    .truth{background:#162324;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;color:#9fd6ca}\\n\\n    /* Pillars as gallery tiles */\\n    .pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:28px}\\n    .pillar{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;min-height:120px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    .pillar h4{margin:0}\\n    .pillar p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* Case studies */\\n    .cases{margin-top:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .case{background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.018), rgba(0,0,0,0.02));padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .case h5{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n    .case p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* CTA / Contact form */\\n    .cta{margin-top:32px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:20px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:20px}\\n    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#e6eef0}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px}\\n    .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}\\n    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#071214;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:980px){\\n      .hero,.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .cases,.pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      nav a{display:none}\\n      nav .mobile{display:inline-block;color:var(--muted)}\\n      .wrap{padding:16px}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden>W</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Memberships</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Contact</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"mobile\\\">Menu</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Hero -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h2 id=\\\"contact-hero\\\">Reach the systems that actually change behavior</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Connect with {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — a scientist-guided coach who translates evidence into precise daily practices and membership support to hold progress steady.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Quick replies: Mon–Fri</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Phone: {{PHONE}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Email: {{EMAIL}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"myth-truth\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-card\\\">\\n            <h3>Common assumption</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"mt-grid\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"myth\\\">Myth: Motivation alone sustains change.</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"truth\\\">Truth: Consistent micro-habits + feedback loops do.</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"myth\\\">Myth: One program fits all.</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"truth\\\">Truth: Frameworks adapt to context and constraints.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-card\\\">\\n            <h3>How I reframe outcomes</h3>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">I map behaviors to measurable signals, prioritize experiments, and build membership accountability so change compounds without burnout.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-visual\\\" aria-hidden>\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Abstract gallery illustration representing patterns and growth\\\" />\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Pillars -->\\n    <section class=\\\"pillars\\\" aria-label=\\\"Core pillars\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <h4>1 — Habit scaffolding</h4>\\n        <p>Design small, repeatable actions that slot into your day and provide measurable signals every week.</p>\\n      </article>\\n      <article class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <h4>2 — Context tuning</h4>\\n        <p>Adjust routines to environment and schedule so progress is resilient to disruption.</p>\\n      </article>\\n      <article class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n        <h4>3 — Group accountability</h4>\\n        <p>Membership structures and micro-cohorts that sustain momentum through social reinforcement.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Case studies gallery -->\\n    <section class=\\\"cases\\\" aria-label=\\\"Selected case studies\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"case\\\">\\n        <h5>6-week habit reset</h5>\\n        <p>Client regained consistent sleep and active recovery with a 3-step evening protocol and weekly feedback. Retention: 92%.</p>\\n      </article>\\n      <article class=\\\"case\\\">\\n        <h5>Workday resilience</h5>\\n        <p>Designed micro-break frameworks for high-stress roles; average stress reactivity reduced by self-reported 28% after 12 weeks.</p>\\n      </article>\\n      <article class=\\\"case\\\">\\n        <h5>Membership launch</h5>\\n        <p>Scaled a monthly support circle that improved adherence to key behaviors through structured prompts and peer review.</p>\\n      </article>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CTA + Contact Form -->\\n    <section class=\\\"cta\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact and join\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3>Start with a 20-minute clarity call</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We’ll evaluate a simple habit experiment you can run this week. If a membership fits, I’ll show which tier aligns with your pace and needs.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule directly</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Prefer email? Write to <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">We respect privacy and use responses to tailor a precise plan. No medical advice is given.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"#\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return handleSubmit(event)\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"inquiry\\\">Inquiry type</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"inquiry\\\" name=\\\"inquiry\\\">\\n            <option>Clarity call</option>\\n            <option>One-on-one coaching</option>\\n            <option>Membership question</option>\\n            <option>Corporate / Team</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Brief description</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"What outcome matters most to you?\\\" required></textarea>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"actions\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request call</button>\\n            <button class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" onclick=\\\"copyEmail()\\\">Email instead</button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_recipient\\\" value=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\" />\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Compact FAQ ripple -->\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px\\\">Questions people often bring</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px\\\">\\n        <details style=\\\"background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <summary style=\\\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer\\\">How does membership differ from one-on-one coaching?</summary>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Membership prioritizes peer accountability, templated experiments, and monthly live reviews. One-on-one is more intensive and tailored with higher frequency of coach feedback.</div>\\n        </details>\\n\\n        <details style=\\\"background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <summary style=\\\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer\\\">What outcomes do you track?</summary>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">We track simple leading indicators: adherence to micro-habits, weekly self-reports, and a few objective signals you choose together (e.g., step counts, sleep windows). No clinical diagnostics here.</div>\\n        </details>\\n\\n        <details style=\\\"background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <summary style=\\\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer\\\">Do you work with teams or organizations?</summary>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Yes—there are scalable packages for teams that combine brief workshops with ongoing cohort support. Contact us to outline objectives and headcount.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> — {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Made for resilient habits. <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function copyEmail(){\\n      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText('{{EMAIL}}')\\n        .then(()=>alert('Email copied to clipboard'))\\n        .catch(()=>alert('Copy this address: {{EMAIL}}'))\\n    }\\n\\n    function handleSubmit(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      // Minimal local validation + simulated submission.\\n      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');\\n      const data = new FormData(form);\\n      // Build a lightweight summary for user confirmation (no external network calls here)\\n      const name = data.get('name');\\n      alert('Thanks, ' + (name||'there') + '! Your request was received. We will reach out within 48 hours.');\\n      form.reset();\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page and integration notes for the wellness coach site (lux_gallery layout).\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — full-contact template built for {{BUSINESS_NAME}} with hero, myth_vs_truth ripple, pillars, case_studies, compact faq, and a prominent CTA/form.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace (keep curly braces):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign & behavior notes:\\n- The page follows the lux_gallery family: large hero visual, gallery-style pillars and case study tiles, restrained color accents.\\n- Voice: scientist_guide — analytical, practical, and evidence-oriented. Copy avoids medical claims and focuses on habits, frameworks, and membership.\\n- The contact form does not post to a server in this template. Replace the form action and add a server-side endpoint or form provider for production. A hidden input _recipient is included with {{EMAIL}} as a hint for email-forwarding setups.\\n\\nAssets expected (not included in this chunk):\\n- assets/img/hero.svg — large hero illustration (unique per template)\\n- assets/img/avatar.svg — small avatar SVG (used on other pages)\\n- assets/img/pattern.svg — decorative pattern (used on other pages)\\n\\nAccessibility & responsiveness:\\n- Basic responsive grid provided; nav collapses on small screens. Form fields are labelled.\\n\\nHow to wire up form submissions:\\n- Option A: Replace form action with a server endpoint that accepts POST and sends to {{EMAIL}}.\\n- Option B: Integrate with a form service (Formspree, Netlify Forms, etc.) by changing method/action and adding required tokens.\\n- Option C: Use AJAX to send JSON to an API and return a success response; update handleSubmit accordingly.\\n\\nQuick customization checklist:\\n- Swap placeholder text with client details.\\n- Add or replace hero SVG in assets/img/hero.svg ensuring it matches the gallery aesthetic.\\n- Connect the primary CTA button ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}) to the booking flow or membership sign-up.\\n\\nNotes about required ripple sections:\\n- This page intentionally includes compact versions of the required index sections: hero, myth_vs_truth, pillars, case_studies, faq, cta — so the design language remains consistent across the site.\\n\\nIf you need server-side templates or translation into a templating language (e.g., Handlebars, Jinja), provide target environment details and I will adapt the markup and placeholders accordingly.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
